<section class="section services"><div class="wrap faq-grid"><div class="faq-intro"><div class="eyebrow">Before you get started</div><h2>Practical questions.<br>Clear answers.</h2></div><div class="faq-list"><details><summary>What does AI consulting cost?</summary><p>The initial business assessment is free. Further discovery, implementation, and ongoing support are scoped to the tools and processes involved. We discuss costs before a paid engagement begins.</p></details><details><summary>Can you work with the software we already use?</summary><p>That is the starting point. We review your existing CRM, email, scheduling, and project tools, then confirm available connections, permissions, and any software limitations before recommending a build.</p></details><details><summary>Do we have to buy an implementation after the assessment?</summary><p>No. The assessment helps you understand the opportunity and decide on a next step. Any implementation is a separate, agreed scope.</p></details><details><summary>How is this different from AI training?</summary><p>Consulting focuses on deciding what to change and how to approach it. Training helps people use the resulting tools and workflows. We discuss the support your team needs as part of the plan.</p></details></div></div></section><div style="height:70px" aria-hidden="true"></div><section class="contact-section" id="contact"><div class="wrap"><div class="contact-panel"><div><div class="eyebrow">Let’s make your next step simple</div><h2 data-reveal="words">A better business<br>starts with a conversation.</h2><p>Tell us where work gets stuck. We’ll start with a free assessment and find the first useful step for your business.</p></div><div class="contact-actions"><a class="button" href="mailto:jesse@simpleten.ai?subject=SimpleTen%20business%20assessment&amp;body=Hi%20Jesse%2C%0A%0AI%20would%20like%20to%20discuss%20a%20Service%20Business%20Blueprint.%0A%0ABusiness%20name%3A%0AWebsite%3A%0ACity%3A%0AThe%20process%20I%20would%2